 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nSunset Picnics\n\nImmerse yourself in the serene beauty of the Tanzanian wilderness with a romantic sunset picnic, meticulously curated by Mazingira Safaris to elevate your safari experience. As the sun sets over the majestic Serengeti, you and your loved one can enjoy a tranquil and intimate dining experience, surrounded by the breathtaking landscapes that make Tanzania a top safari destination.\n\n \n\nSafety and Comfort in the Wilderness\nYour safety and comfort are our utmost priorities. To ensure a secure environment, a knowledgeable Maasai guide will accompany you, offering both protection and fascinating insights into the local flora and fauna. The Maasai's presence enriches the experience, blending cultural heritage with the natural beauty of the bush.\n\n \n\nTailored to Your Preference\nWe understand that each guest has unique comfort levels and preferences. For those who prefer not to stray far from the safety of a vehicle, we can arrange for the picnic to be set up within or near the truck. For the more adventurous spirits, a comfortable and scenic setup in the bush will provide an unobstructed view of the sunset, creating a truly immersive experience. All locations are carefully selected within a 20-minute drive from your accommodation, ensuring you spend more time enjoying the moment and less time traveling.\n\n \n\nA Dining Experience Like No Other\nAs the sky paints itself with the glorious colors of the African sunset, you will be treated to a hot food picnic featuring a mix of local and international cuisine. To cater to all preferences, we provide a selection of both alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages. Cozy blankets are also provided, perfect for snuggling under as the evening air cools, adding an extra layer of comfort and romance to the setting.\n\n \n\nWhy Add This to Your Trip?\nAdding a sunset picnic to your safari trip offers a unique opportunity to create lasting memories with your partner. It’s not just a meal; it’s a moment to connect, to enjoy each other's company in one of the most stunning settings on earth. This experience combines the thrill of adventure with the intimacy of a quiet, private meal, making it an ideal choice for those looking to celebrate love, anniversaries, honeymoons, or simply the joy of shared experience.\n\n \n\nA sunset picnic with Mazingira Safaris isn't just another meal; it's a celebration of love, nature, and tranquility, all wrapped into one exclusive and memorable package. Whether you're watching the wildlife in the distance or gazing into a starlit sky, this experience promises to be as enchanting as it is unforgettable.\n\nWidget Didn’t Load\nCheck your internet and refresh this page.\nIf that doesn’t work, contact us.\nRefresh this page\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
